{"id":"752f53ceb23d931c","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction.md","title":"λ 演算的同时归约","display":"df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction — λ 演算的同时归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction","aliases":["56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction"],"display":"df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction — λ 演算的同时归约","depends_on":["[[56-df-beta-reduction]]","[[56-df-lambda-term]]","[[56-df-lambda-substitution]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definition 10.2.1, printed p555","source_ocr_block":"576","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction — λ 演算的同时归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"650401013847f443\" href=\"?note=650401013847f443\" title=\"56-df-beta-reduction\">56-df-beta-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d547d7414660f6bd\" href=\"?note=d547d7414660f6bd\" title=\"56-df-lambda-term\">56-df-lambda-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"96add5833bb7dcac\" href=\"?note=96add5833bb7dcac\" title=\"56-df-lambda-substitution\">56-df-lambda-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definition 10.2.1, printed p555"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"576"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在无类型无常元 λ 演算中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)\">\\(\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)\\)</span>。项及构造按 α 商解释，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[x:=N]\">\\(M[x:=N]\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"96add5833bb7dcac\" href=\"?note=96add5833bb7dcac\" title=\"56-df-lambda-substitution\">56-df-lambda-substitution</a> 中正式构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,\\varnothing,V^2}(M,x,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,\\varnothing,V^2}(M,x,N)\\)</span>。下列关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_n\\subseteq\\Lambda^2\">\\(P_n\\subseteq\\Lambda^2\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 分层构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_0\\coloneqq\\{([x]_\\alpha,[x]_\\alpha):x\\in V\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_0\\coloneqq\\{([x]_\\alpha,[x]_\\alpha):x\\in V\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_{n+1}\\coloneqq P_n\\cup\\{(MN,M&#39;N&#39;):(M,M&#39;),(N,N&#39;)\\in P_n\\}\\cup\\{(\\lambda x.M,\\lambda x.N):(M,N)\\in P_n,x\\in V\\}\\cup\\{((\\lambda x.M)N,M&#39;[x:=N&#39;]):(M,M&#39;),(N,N&#39;)\\in P_n,x\\in V\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_{n+1}\\coloneqq P_n\\cup\\{(MN,M&#39;N&#39;):(M,M&#39;),(N,N&#39;)\\in P_n\\}\\cup\\{(\\lambda x.M,\\lambda x.N):(M,N)\\in P_n,x\\in V\\}\\cup\\{((\\lambda x.M)N,M&#39;[x:=N&#39;]):(M,M&#39;),(N,N&#39;)\\in P_n,x\\in V\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}P_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}P_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 10.2.1（印刷 p555，OCR 页块576）。这是允许嵌套 redex 同时归约的归纳关系，不等于一阶系统“互不相交位置”的并行步。阶段并集是所列规则的最小闭包。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-beta-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"650401013847f443","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-beta-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-term","status":"resolved","id":"d547d7414660f6bd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"96add5833bb7dcac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"96add5833bb7dcac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在无类型无常元 λ 演算中，$\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$。项及构造按 α 商解释，$M[x:=N]$ 使用 [[56-df-lambda-substitution]] 中正式构造的 $\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,\\varnothing,V^2}(M,x,N)$。下列关系 $P_n\\subseteq\\Lambda^2$ 按 $n\\in\\mathbb N$ 分层构造，$x\\in V$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)","display":false},{"tex":"M[x:=N]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,\\varnothing,V^2}(M,x,N)","display":false},{"tex":"P_n\\subseteq\\Lambda^2","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"P_0\\coloneqq\\{([x]_\\alpha,[x]_\\alpha):x\\in V\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"P_{n+1}\\coloneqq P_n\\cup\\{(MN,M'N'):(M,M'),(N,N')\\in P_n\\}\\cup\\{(\\lambda x.M,\\lambda x.N):(M,N)\\in P_n,x\\in V\\}\\cup\\{((\\lambda x.M)N,M'[x:=N']):(M,M'),(N,N')\\in P_n,x\\in V\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}P_n.","display":true}],"bytes":1444,"backlinks":[{"id":"e75dc86b680683eb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]] 的无常元无类型实例，令 $L=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,\\varnothing)$、$\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_{\\alpha,V^2}$。$M,N,P\\in L$、$x\\in V$，$m\\in\\Lambda$。$\\operatorname{Dev}:L\\to L$ 按有限原始项树递归；替换取 [[56-df-lambda-substitution]] 的原始项函数。"},{"id":"72b587eaf1edf078","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]] 的无类型无常元实例，令 $\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$\\Rightarrow_\\lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda^2$ 为其中的同时归约。$M,M',N,N'\\in\\Lambda$，$x\\in V$。$M[x:=N]=\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,\\varnothing,V^2}(M,x,N)$ 为 [[56-df-lambda-substitution]] 的商上无捕获替换；其代表元独立性、改名规则和输入域沿用该内部定义。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-292","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction.md]]"},{"id":"f84615aea647a602","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$\\to_\\beta$ 是无类型 λ 演算的 β 归约，$\\Rightarrow_\\lambda$ 为同时归约，见 [[56-df-lambda-simultaneous-reduction]]。"}],"outgoing":["650401013847f443","d547d7414660f6bd","96add5833bb7dcac"]}